{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1537969-question-about-weapon-tags","id":1537969,"title":"Question about weapon tags","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-07-01T16:38:00-07:00","id":1537969,"title":"Question about weapon tags","content":"I'm reading thru Origin, and am on page 122-125, dealing with weapon tags. I'm not clear how the points interact with your character. For example, Automatic (2), Brutal (1), Two-Handed (-1). Do the numbers in parentheses represent enhancements? Tag slots for the 3 tag limit? I understand applying the text block afterwards but I have no idea how to apply the numbers in the parentheses to the character using the weapon. Thanks for any clarification you can provide!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3761-yab","name":"Yab","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-01T16:57:22-07:00","id":1537970,"title":"","content":"p. 122: &quot;A weapon may have up to three total points of tags.&quot; That's what the numbers are. You can have more than 3 <i>tags,</i> but summing up all the weapon's <i>tag points</i> can't exceed 3. Negative numbers let you fit more positive number tags. The numbers don't directly do anything else, they're just how much &quot;tag space&quot; each tag occupies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":522,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","user":"Stupid Loserman","date":". 07-01-2024, 07:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-03T19:00:36-07:00","id":1538064,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1537969-question-about-weapon-tags?p=1537970#post1537970\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">p. 122: &quot;A weapon may have up to three total points of tags.&quot; That's what the numbers are. You can have more than 3 <i>tags,</i> but summing up all the weapon's <i>tag points</i> can't exceed 3. Negative numbers let you fit more positive number tags. The numbers don't directly do anything else, they're just how much &quot;tag space&quot; each tag occupies.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! I appreciate the explanation. I read that paragraph multiple times and didn\u2019t put that together until you spelled it out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3761-yab","name":"Yab","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}